<BlogPost
  title="Ocean Tides: How the Moon's Gravity Shapes Our Seas"
  description="Discover how gravitational forces from the Moon and Sun create ocean tides, why we have two high tides per day, and the surprising tidal effects beyond Earth's oceans."
